{"file_name": "2b4153bb27a4c28c.pdf", "category": "hr", "text": "RONNIE MOHR\n\n51248 VANDERVORT STATION, BOSTON, MA\n\nPHONE\n+1 (555) 198 7330\n\nEXPERIENCE HINTZ GROUP 08/2019 \u2014 present\nPhiladelphia, PA // HR Technology\n\n\u00a2 Possesses significant technical skills and has a broad knowledge of how various technologies\nare integrated\n\n\u00a2 Highly proficient in leading the development, and continuous improvement of technical\nsolution roadmaps\n\ne Displays a commitment to growing technical skills and discovering new and better ways to\ndeliver technical and application solutions\n\ne Skilled in creating and delivering presentations to staff and customers\n\ne Experience establishing effective partnerships across the HR and IT organizations and\ninfluencing management, peers and direct reports in an inclusive style to leverage their\nabilities and knowledge\n\nTOY-WUNSCH 04/2014 \u2014 06/2019\nPhiladelphia, PA // HR Technology\n\ne Good understanding of HR, Payroll, Finance and IT business processes intra and inter-\ndepartmental functions and interdependencies\n\n\u00a2 Customer Focus \u2014 Has a passion for meeting customer needs with a positive attitude\n\nCollaboration - Working effectively and cooperatively with others\n\ne Issue Resolution - Responds quickly to address raised issues\n\ne Managing Work - Effectively managing one's time to ensure that work is completed efficiently\n\n\u00a2 Quality Orientation - Accomplishing tasks by considering all areas involved\n\nEDUCATION FASHION INSTITUTE OF DESIGN & MERCHANDISING\nBachelor's in Business\n\nSKILLS e Deep understanding of HCM, LMS, and payroll systems\n\n\u00a2 Knowledge of concepts, practices, policies and procedures related to internal and external\nfactors influencing Human Resources and the full life cycle employee experience, basic\nbusiness drivers and metrics\n\ne Strong written and verbal communication skills, including demonstrated facilitation skills\n\ne Strong business acumen to proactively assess organizational issues and trends that translate to\npotential impacts on business\n\ne Strong problem solving, analytical, critical thinking and change management skills", "embedding": [-0.09332509338855743, 0.09194289147853851, 0.07845334708690643, -0.015478111803531647, -0.07259733229875565, -0.02649344690144062, 0.01821420155465603, 0.010449578054249287, -0.06297415494918823, -0.007689846679568291, -0.034408267587423325, 0.017317039892077446, 0.04858199879527092, -0.03944752737879753, -0.0027132767718285322, -0.01657985895872116, 0.04589320346713066, -0.037539344280958176, 0.022095542401075363, -0.006402331870049238, -0.0028020755853503942, -0.02091924473643303, 0.004555682651698589, -0.06737689673900604, -0.10052739083766937, 0.05366983637213707, 0.011325119994580746, 0.02700871415436268, -0.013395874761044979, -0.11527194827795029, -0.005297613795846701, 0.0778009444475174, 0.006713932380080223, 0.024739012122154236, 0.015175880864262581, 0.11256049573421478, 0.0350005067884922, 0.012143771164119244, 0.03669926896691322, -0.008009793236851692, -0.053452085703611374, -0.09347402304410934, -0.07127653807401657, -0.06578486412763596, 0.04509913921356201, -0.07173769921064377, -0.020226791501045227, -0.040063466876745224, -0.045404668897390366, -0.004173186607658863, -0.0759321078658104, -0.08158891648054123, 0.1016344353556633, -0.007416921202093363, 0.0033894404768943787, 0.12867313623428345, 0.03739021345973015, 0.03819539397954941, -0.04921125993132591, -0.06303668767213821, -0.0326954610645771, 0.011287432163953781, -0.041892338544130325, -0.026646889746189117, 0.07006905972957611, -0.04003211110830307, -0.08011287450790405, 0.0231160968542099, -0.08871044218540192, -0.0811096727848053, -0.025457661598920822, -0.07261006534099579, -0.08270452171564102, 0.04297458007931709, 0.07215277850627899, 0.03877351060509682, 0.033547475934028625, -0.0059211780317127705, 0.06619875878095627, -0.027199789881706238, 0.047510601580142975, 0.0471729375422